  "slug": "papa-oriolds-spaetzle",
  "name": "Papa Oriold's Spaetzle",
  "recipe_type": "soup",
  "brief_description": "With only 5 ingredients and about 15 minutes, you can make these authentic little German noodles as a great addition to soup or your favorite sauce.",
  "cuisine": "German",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Mix flour, water, eggs, salt, and baking powder in a bowl until blended."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Bring a large pot of water to a boil. Place part of the dough into a spaetzle press or potato ricer. Press dough into boiling water; cook and stir until pasta floats, about 2 minutes. Remove with a slotted spoon and rinse with water; repeat with remaining dough."
    }
  ],
